 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "points are sorted by strictly increasing x. For each consecutive pair whose x gap exceeds interval, insert points at x1+interval, x1+2*interval, ... strictly before x2, with y on the segment between the two points. Gaps above interval are multiples of interval. Return all original and inserted points in x order as [x, y] with y as an exact reduced fraction string.",
